This folder is the "local-release" NuGet package source declared in src/NuGet.Config.

DO NOT DELETE THIS FILE.

NuGet fails with NU1301 when a configured folder source does not exist, and that error cannot be
suppressed with NoWarn, RestoreNoWarn, or WarningsNotAsErrors. Removing this marker breaks every
restore in the repository, for everyone, including people who never use eng/Download-PackageRelease.ps1.

The .nupkg files here are produced by:

    ./eng/Download-PackageRelease.ps1

and are intentionally not tracked by git.
